WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.709 --> 00:00:03.376
(intense music)

00:00:08.969 --> 00:00:09.802
- Holy

00:00:15.407 --> 00:00:16.836
- Welcome to episode three

00:00:16.836 --> 00:00:18.662
of Buzzfeed's, Running Out of Ideas.

00:00:18.662 --> 00:00:20.160
Yes, it's still the same day.

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:22.294
What we've done is took popular key words

00:00:22.294 --> 00:00:23.460
and put them on some dice.

00:00:23.460 --> 00:00:25.514
Then we roll those dice
and whatever combination

00:00:25.514 --> 00:00:27.961
