the title of our video.

00:00:27.961 --> 00:00:29.952
So let's get to it for a third time.

00:00:29.952 --> 00:00:31.381
(door opens)

00:00:31.381 --> 00:00:33.739
Okay, so I'm here with the team.

00:00:33.739 --> 00:00:36.290
We're ready to roll the dice
and find ourselves a video.

00:00:36.290 --> 00:00:37.178
Go!

00:00:37.178 --> 00:00:38.011
(die clank)

00:00:38.011 --> 00:00:38.844
Alright!

00:00:38.844 --> 00:00:39.677
- There we go
- [Jordan] Whooo!

00:00:39.677 --> 00:00:41.006
